-- the interconversion between them: delocalization, which is not a reaction with a rate but the
-- electronic ground state, so it is faster than any observation whatever. One minute stands for the
-- fastest nonzero half-life this carrier can name.
kek-conv : Interconv Kek
kek-conv a b = case a of
  kek-a → (case b of kek-a → 0; kek-b → 1)
  kek-b → (case b of kek-a → 1; kek-b → 0)
